  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table gives daily prophylactic doses of co-trimoxazole, isoniazid, the isoniazid/co-trimoxazole/vitamin B6 combination and fluconazole for children: for each drug and formulation, the recommended daily dose and the dose to give in each of seven weight bands from 3 kg to over 30 kg.",
